{"id":4892,"title":{"romaji":"ONE PIECE HEROINES","english":"ONE PIECE HEROINES","native":"ONE PIECE HEROINES"},"slug":"one_piece_heroines","synopsis":"Based on the novel series *ONE PIECE* novel *HEROINES*, one chapter, “episode : NAMI” is getting an anime adaptation.\n\nAfter buying a pair of shoes that end up hurting her feet, Nami returns to the shop feeling dissatisfied. There, she meets Lebno, the designer, who tells her, “I’ll make you a brand-new pair from scratch—but only if you’ll be my model.” The shoes are crafted by the artisan Miucha, leading to an unexpected and stylish encounter.\n\n(Source: Toei Animation)","format":"SPECIAL","season":"SUMMER","year":2026,"createdAt":"2026-06-30 01:15:20","updatedAt":"2026-06-30 01:15:20","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":197178},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":27028},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":19524},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":50089},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":13271},{"site":"MAL","externalId":62233},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":82904737},{"site":"ANN","externalId":37416}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":13445,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/HPcK4KUXOddcpFcU5P5nED2ah1j5Idf3Mk1t2HBB.avif"},{"id":13446,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/3ImonIltXHDJVW4AxCYyH9IsmHNqfmOR5zKMXi6K.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":356,"name":"One Piece","slug":"one_piece"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":14526,"slug":"IN","type":"IN","sequence":null,"song":{"id":14427,"title":{"romaji":"Blue Shining Star","native":"Blue Shining Star"}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":16996,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[]}}]}]}
